{"2230000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "1WEEK", "steam_appid": 2230000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek refuge underground before the apocalypse strikes and survive in a world without oxygen by relying on genetically modified plants. Explore the depths, discover new biomes, and find every species before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/f808899f0e09eb99254b4f22564e590c.poster.avif?t=1786381992\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/f808899f0e09eb99254b4f22564e590c.webm?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/f808899f0e09eb99254b4f22564e590c.mp4?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and build an underground shelter to protect yourself from the dangers outside. Craft workstations, organize your supplies, and transform a small refuge into a place capable of keeping you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/58cf664ee4488465ca06d88c53f3b38a.poster.avif?t=1786381992\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/58cf664ee4488465ca06d88c53f3b38a.webm?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/58cf664ee4488465ca06d88c53f3b38a.mp4?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself against those corrupted by hunger and isolation. Fight, loot, and do whatever it takes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/14dc08d1d97caba8e7a4f34f37ee7ecd.poster.avif?t=1786381992\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/14dc08d1d97caba8e7a4f34f37ee7ecd.webm?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/14dc08d1d97caba8e7a4f34f37ee7ecd.mp4?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single-player PvE sandbox survival experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crafting system with multiple workstations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Flexible base-building system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Weapons and tools for combat, gathering, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mine, extract, and refine valuable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight zombies and other underground creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grow genetically modified plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cook food and manage your supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic day-and-night cycle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Character conditions and status effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Oxygen and breathable-area management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedurally generated maps and resource distribution.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek refuge underground before the apocalypse strikes and survive in a world without oxygen by relying on genetically modified plants. Explore the depths, discover new biomes, and find every species before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/f808899f0e09eb99254b4f22564e590c.poster.avif?t=1786381992\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/f808899f0e09eb99254b4f22564e590c.webm?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/f808899f0e09eb99254b4f22564e590c.mp4?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and build an underground shelter to protect yourself from the dangers outside. Craft workstations, organize your supplies, and transform a small refuge into a place capable of keeping you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/58cf664ee4488465ca06d88c53f3b38a.poster.avif?t=1786381992\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/58cf664ee4488465ca06d88c53f3b38a.webm?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/58cf664ee4488465ca06d88c53f3b38a.mp4?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself against those corrupted by hunger and isolation. Fight, loot, and do whatever it takes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/14dc08d1d97caba8e7a4f34f37ee7ecd.poster.avif?t=1786381992\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/14dc08d1d97caba8e7a4f34f37ee7ecd.webm?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230000/extras/14dc08d1d97caba8e7a4f34f37ee7ecd.mp4?t=1786381992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single-player PvE sandbox survival experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crafting system with multiple workstations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Flexible base-building system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Weapons and tools for combat, gathering, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mine, extract, and refine valuable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight zombies and other underground creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grow genetically modified plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cook food and manage your supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic day-and-night cycle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Character conditions and status effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Oxygen and breathable-area management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedurally generated maps and resource distribution.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "1WEEK is a single-player PvE survival sandbox set in a post-apocalyptic world. Dig an underground shelter, explore hostile biomes, loot, gather resources, craft, farm, and fight to become self-sufficient before your week’s supplies run out.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spa